      "proof_review": {
        "reviewed": true,
        "context_checked": true,
        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Read the full abstract factorization proof of Theorem 4.5 and its Lemmas 4.1-4.4, the equivariant tilting proof of Theorem 3.27, the split restriction/induction adjunction of Lemma 3.17, and the faithful diagram argument of Lemmas 3.28-3.29, together with Theorem 4.7 and all Section 3.4/4.3 hypotheses. Standard bounded tilting full faithfulness is explicitly cited to Happel after the Add(T)-projective construction; standard factorization totalization and lifting results are identified prior background. Only part (2) is selected; the partial-tilting branch and Pfaffian applications are not separate claims."
